  "details": "<p>The site of the\u00a0Phaleron cemetery in Attica, also referred to as \"Phaleron Delta\", was documented during construction works for the Stavros Niarchos Foundation Cultural Centre. During 2012-2013 an area of some 3,000 square meters was excavated, expanding upon a site first identified in the early twentieth century. Some 1,069 graves (eighth to fifth centuries B.C.) were documented.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A cemetery at Phaleron with burials ranging in date from the Archaic to the Classical period.",
